Package: RiccatiSolver
Type: Package
Title: Resolution et Analyse des Equations Differentielles de Riccati
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Pauline", "Moubitang", email = "yakanpauline79@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Outils pour definir, resoudre numeriquement, representer,
    comparer et analyser les equations de Riccati y' = a(x) y^2 + b(x) y + c(x),
    y compris la transformation en equation lineaire du second ordre.
